{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/539340/extras/df8a8034140d9313724474e996346375.avif?t=1637141482\" width=616 height=162 /></span><br><br>Future Unfolding is an action adventure that is all about exploration. Your goal is to unfold the mysteries and solve the puzzles hidden in the beautiful landscapes around you. There are no tutorials, and no one is telling you what to do.<br><br>During your journey you encounter different types of wild animals. Some of them are friendly and helpful. Other animals are dangerous \u2014 deadly, even. You need to avoid them, or find ways to turn them into friendly creatures.<br><br>You can leave the beaten path at any time and hunt down secrets in the forgotten woods. Or go explore in hidden caves. It\u2019s okay to get lost \u2014 a detailed auto-map helps you to orient yourself. Over time you map out more and more of the vast environments. There is always a way out. But where to go after?","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"456c9e529770d8868a2ecd4131799bac33404ad1.jpg","localized_name":"Hidden Place","name":"Hidden Place","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/539340/456c9e529770d8868a2ecd4131799bac33404ad1.jpg"},{"icon":"cae026821e4de7b59ec0c5f267bfbed54aa8cd6c.jpg","localized_name":"Lost in the Woods","name":"Lost in the Woods","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/539340/cae026821e4de7b59ec0c5f267bfbed54aa8cd6c.jpg"},{"icon":"bd6d6450a37b25f3535f1922ec632f328082bf14.jpg","localized_name":"In Circles","name":"In Circles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/539340/bd6d6450a37b25f3535f1922ec632f328082bf14.jpg"},{"icon":"6de338a8a91d0eb62a3ead5ec3c54be78b816587.jpg","localized_name":"Practice","name":"Practice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/539340/6de338a8a91d0